## Requirements

- Python {{ spec.python }}
- [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/)

## Setup

Create the virtual environment and install the dependencies:

```sh
uv sync
```
{% if spec.has_environment %}

Copy the example environment file and adjust it for your machine:

```sh
cp .env.example .env
```
{% endif %}

## Run

Start the development server:

```sh
uv run fastapi dev src/{{ spec.package }}/main.py
```

The API is available at <http://127.0.0.1:8000>. Interactive documentation is
served at <http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs>.

## Test

```sh
uv run pytest
```

## Lint and type-check

```sh
uv run ruff format --check .
uv run ruff check .
uv run mypy src
uv run pyright src
```

Apply formatting and safe lint fixes with:

```sh
uv run ruff format .
uv run ruff check --fix .
```
{% if spec.has("pre-commit") %}

## Pre-commit hooks

Install the Git hooks once per clone:

```sh
uv run pre-commit install
```

Run all hooks manually:

```sh
uv run pre-commit run --all-files
```
{% endif %}
{% if spec.has("docker") %}

## Docker

Build and run the container:

```sh
docker build -t {{ spec.name }} .
docker run --rm -p 8000:8000{% if spec.has_environment %} --env-file .env{% endif %} {{ spec.name }}
```
{% endif %}
{% if spec.has("alembic") %}

## Database migrations

Create a migration after changing the SQLAlchemy models:

```sh
uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe the change"
```

Apply the pending migrations:

```sh
uv run alembic upgrade head
```
{% endif %}

